---
    import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
    import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
    import SeoHead from '../components/SeoHead.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <SeoHead
            title="Privacy Policy | SafePlots"
            description="SafePlots Privacy Policy - Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal data for our plot monitoring and management services."
            canonical="https://safeplots.com/privacy/"
            keywords="Privacy Policy, Data Protection, SafePlots, NRI Services, Plot Monitoring"
        />
    </head>
    <body class="page-legal">
        <Header />

        <main class="legal-content container">
            <div class="legal-hero">
                <div class="legal-kicker text-mono">Legal Documentation</div>
                <h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
                <div class="legal-updated text-mono">
                    Last Updated: January 2026
                </div>
            </div>

            <section class="legal-summary" aria-label="Quick Summary">
                <h2 class="legal-summary-title text-mono">Quick Summary</h2>
                <div class="legal-summary-grid">
                    <div class="legal-summary-card">
                        <div class="legal-summary-card-title">
                            Data Security
                        </div>
                        <p class="legal-summary-card-desc">
                            We use standard security measures to protect your
                            personal data.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="legal-summary-card">
                        <div class="legal-summary-card-title">Transparency</div>
                        <p class="legal-summary-card-desc">
                            We explain what we collect, why we collect it, and
                            how it’s used.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="legal-summary-card">
                        <div class="legal-summary-card-title">Your Rights</div>
                        <p class="legal-summary-card-desc">
                            You can request access, correction, or deletion of
                            your personal information.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <div class="legal-text">
                <h3>1. Introduction</h3>
                <p>
                    Welcome to SafePlots ("we," "our," or "us"). This Privacy
                    Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard
                    your information when you use our website, mobile
                    application, and services (collectively, the "Services").
                    SafePlots provides professional plot maintenance,
                    monitoring, and management services for vacant land owners
                    across India, with a focus on serving Non-Resident Indians
                    (NRIs) and remote property owners.
                </p>
                <p>
                    By using our Services, you agree to the collection and use
                    of information in accordance with this Privacy Policy. If
                    you do not agree with the terms of this Privacy Policy,
                    please do not access or use our Services.
                </p>

                <h3>2. Information We Collect</h3>

                <h4>2.1 Personal Information</h4>
                <p>
                    We collect personal information that you voluntarily provide
                    to us when you:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Register for an account</li>
                    <li>Subscribe to our services</li>
                    <li>Book plot maintenance or monitoring services</li>
                    <li>Contact us through forms or email</li>
                    <li>Subscribe to our newsletter</li>
                    <li>Participate in surveys or promotions</li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    The personal information we collect may include:
                    <strong>Contact Information</strong> (name, email address,
                    phone number, mailing address),
                    <strong>Account Information</strong> (username, password),
                    <strong>Property Information</strong> (plot location, size,
                    type, ownership documents),
                    <strong>Payment Information</strong> (billing details), and
                    <strong>Identification Documents</strong> (when required).
                </p>

                <h4>2.2 Automatically Collected Information</h4>
                <p>
                    When you access our Services, we automatically collect
                    certain information, including device information (IP
                    address, browser type, OS), usage data, location data, and
                    cookies.
                </p>

                <h4>2.3 Service-Specific Information</h4>
                <p>
                    Through our plot monitoring and maintenance services, we may
                    collect:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Geo-Tagged Photos</strong>: Images of your plot
                        with GPS coordinates and timestamps
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Drone Footage</strong>: Aerial photographs and
                        videos of your property
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Inspection Reports</strong>: Detailed condition
                        assessments and maintenance logs
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Visit Records</strong>: Date, time, and details
                        of supervisor visits to your plot
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h3>3. How We Use Your Information</h3>
                <h4>3.1 Service Delivery</h4>
                <p>
                    We use your information to provide, maintain, and improve
                    our services, schedule visits, generate inspection reports,
                    and manage your account.
                </p>

                <h4>3.2 Communication</h4>
                <p>
                    To respond to inquiries, send administrative updates,
                    provide newsletters (with consent), and notify you about
                    changes to our Services.
                </p>

                <h4>3.3 Business Operations</h4>
                <p>
                    To process payments, prevent fraud, analyze usage patterns,
                    comply with legal obligations, and resolve disputes.
                </p>

                <h4>3.4 Marketing and Advertising</h4>
                <p>
                    To send promotional offers, conduct surveys, and display
                    targeted advertisements (with consent).
                </p>

                <h3>4. How We Share Your Information</h3>
                <h4>4.1 Service Providers</h4>
                <p>
                    We may share information with third-party providers for
                    payment processing, cloud hosting, email services, and
                    analytics.
                </p>

                <h4>4.2 Field Supervisors</h4>
                <p>
                    We may share necessary information with verified field
                    supervisors to deliver maintenance services.
                </p>

                <h4>4.3 Legal Requirements</h4>
                <p>
                    We may disclose information if required by law, to protect
                    our rights, or investigate fraud.
                </p>

                <h4>4.4 Business Transfers</h4>
                <p>
                    If SafePlots is involved in a merger or sale, your
                    information may be transferred with notice.
                </p>

                <h3>5. Data Security</h3>
                <p>
                    We implement technical security measures (SSL, encryption,
                    access controls) to protect your data. However, no internet
                    transmission is 100% secure.
                </p>

                <h3>6. Data Retention</h3>
                <p>
                    We retain account information while active and for a period
                    after closure. We may retain service records and payment
                    records longer where required for legal, business, or
                    compliance purposes.
                </p>

                <h3>7. Your Privacy Rights</h3>
                <p>You may have the right to:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Access</strong>: Request a copy of your data
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Correction</strong>: Request correction of
                        inaccurate data
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Deletion</strong>: Request deletion (subject to
                        legal exceptions)
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Opt-Out</strong>: Unsubscribe from marketing
                        emails
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    Contact us at
                    <a href="mailto:admin@safeplots.com">admin@safeplots.com</a>
                    to exercise these rights.
                </p>

                <h3>8. Cookies</h3>
                <p>
                    We use essential, functional, analytics, and advertising
                    cookies. You can manage preferences in your browser.
                </p>

                <h3>9. Children's Privacy</h3>
                <p>Our Services are not for individuals under 18.</p>

                <h3>10. International Transfers</h3>
                <p>
                    Your data may be processed on servers outside your country
                    with appropriate safeguards.
                </p>

                <h3>11. Changes to Policy</h3>
                <p>
                    We may update this policy. Continued use indicates
                    acceptance of the updated policy.
                </p>

                <h3>12. Contact Us</h3>
                <p>
                    Email:
                    <a href="mailto:admin@safeplots.com">admin@safeplots.com</a
                    ><br />
                    Phone: <a href="tel:+917780391340">+91 77803 91340</a><br />
                    Address: SafePlots, H.No.84, Maruthi Hill Society, Suraksha
                    Colony, Bandam Kommu, Chanda Nagar, Hyderabad, Telangana
                    500050
                </p>
            </div>
        </main>

        <Footer />

        <script src="/src/scripts/app.js?v=20260210"></script>
        <script src="/src/scripts/posthog-init.js?v=20260210"></script>
    </body>
</html>
